<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>That God exists I can’t deny.</l><l>I won’t be drugged by Satan’s lie.</l><l>I’ve touched the light, His presence true,</l><l>In Him, the darkness I refuse.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Though some reject the way they’re made,</l><l>The Potter’s hand made no mistake.</l><l>The Spirit in my spirit speaks,</l><l>The way I’m made brings life and peace.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Lord Jesus, You’re reality.</l><l>Your word brings light and life to me.</l><l>Renew my mind and heal my sight.</l><l>Be all my musing day and night!</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Lord, in Your church we come again,</l><l>Beneath an open, crystal heav’n.</l><l>Enlightened, constituted to</l><l>Be built a pillar of the truth.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
